## 8. Explicitly out of scope

- Chroma / RAG (Phase 7)
- Trending history, macro/news, X ingestion
- Any write path to tokens, wallets, or trades
- Auto-posting intelligence to Discord channels (adjacent, but its own phase —
  push semantics need their own rate/noise policy)
- A `CLEAR` or "safe" verdict. Not out of scope by sequencing — out of scope
  by design.

---

## 9. One-line truth

**Phase 6 projects existing Phase 1–5 state through one deterministic presenter
into HTTP, Telegram and Discord; it adds no data sources, no analyzers and no
execution paths, and it never renders absent evidence as safety.**
